  "screenshotPath": "/home/onnwee/.t3/userdata/browser-artifacts/browser-screenshot-benjamincreative-me-mureltt2-f6d1b335.png",
  "bodyText": "Benjamin\n\n®\n\nDigital Product Designer\n\nH\no\nm\ne\n\nA\nb\no\nu\nt\n\n*\n\nW\no\nr\nk\ns\n\n//\n\nL\ne\nt\n'\ns\n \nt\na\nl\nk\n\n(About me)\n\nI’m Benjamin Hoang,\na Digital Product Designer\nbased in Vietnam.\n\n/ 2026 /\n\nScroll down\n\nS\nT\nA\nR\nT\n \nT\nH\nE\n \nP\nR\nO\nJ\nE\nC\nT\n\nBenjamin Hoang\n\nC\n\nVietnamese Kiddo\n\nC\n\nBenjamin Hoang\n\nC\n\nVietnamese Kiddo\n\nC\n\nMy Recently\nSelected Works\n\n(GPT® — 579)\n\n/From zero to one/\n\n(01)\nHRM Varmeta\n2025\n(02)\nSMG-AI\n2025\n(03)\nChanAI\n2025\n(04)\nAntiGravity\n2026\n(05)\nNTH Studio\n2025\n(06)\nNago Dave\n2025\n(07)\nAI trans\n2025\n(08)\nEMSenergy\n2025\n\n                      Design is the strategic, the intentional,\nand often the invisible process of making\nfunctional, aesthetically pleasing solutions that\nimprove user experience.\n\nBe Real *\nBe Creative #\nBe Bold ™\nDesign\nskill sets\n\n(GPT® — 579)\n\n                              I propose an end-to-end design process that spans my skills in Digital Product Design for websites and mobile applications, with a high-standard UI/Visual and UX prudence.\n\nUI design\n\n(06)\n\nVisual direction\n1\nDesign concept\n2\nTypography\n3\nColor\n4\nComposition\n5\nUI style guide\n6\nUX design\n\n(05)\n\nUX research\n1\nUsability testing\n2\nQuantitative research\n3\nQualitative research\n4\nUser interview\n5\nWebsite development\n\n(05)\n\nFramer\n1\nWebflow\n2\nMost designers make things look good. I make things feel inevitable — where every pixel has a reason.\n\nBENJAMIN HOANG\n\n/2026/\n\nPortfolio@26\n\nDesign services *\n\nWebsite design\n\nProduct design\n\nUI/Visual design\n\nI build experiences that get under your skin — where the visual stops you, the interaction pulls you in, and the brand stays with you long after you’ve closed the tab.\n\nBenjamin ( . 79)\n\n(\n\nHave something crazy in\nyour mind? Let’s visualize it\ntogether!\n\n)\n\nS\nT\nA\nR\nT\n \nT\nH\nE\n \nP\nR\nO\nJ\nE\nC\nT\n\nLet’s connect \n\nC\n\nLet’s connect \n\nC\n\nVIETNAM, DNA 36 THANH HOA\n\nWORKING\nGLOBALLY\n\nVNM\n\n©2026 BENJAMIN, ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\nBehance\n\nDribbble\n\nAwwwards\n\nTwitter (X)\n\ncuongdesign579@gmail.com\n\n    ",
